---
import ProseLayout from '../layouts/ProseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<ProseLayout
  title="Educational and medical disclaimer"
  eyebrow="Legal"
  lead={`${site.name} is a learning tool. It is not a source of medical advice and not a substitute for professional training.`}
  description={`Educational and medical disclaimer for ${site.name}: simulations are simplified learning models and do not provide medical advice.`}
  updated={site.legalUpdated}
>
  <div class="callout callout-warn">
    <p>
      <strong>If you have a medical concern or emergency, contact a qualified health professional or your local
      emergency number immediately.</strong> Do not rely on this website for health decisions.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>Educational purpose</h2>
  <p>
    Every simulation, explanation, diagram and quiz on {site.name} is designed to help people learn scientific concepts.
    The content is general in nature and is not tailored to any individual’s circumstances.
  </p>

  <h2>Simulations are simplified models</h2>
  <p>
    To make complex systems understandable and to run smoothly in a web browser, our simulations deliberately simplify
    reality. Numbers, rates, sizes and timescales may be approximate, scaled or idealized. Each simulator page explains
    the main simplifications it makes. Results from a simulation should not be treated as precise predictions of real
    biological, chemical, physical or environmental systems.
  </p>

  <h2>No medical advice</h2>
  <p>
    Content related to anatomy, physiology, nursing, medicine or health — including any discussion of clinical
    examples such as intravenous fluids — is provided for education only. It does <strong>not</strong> constitute
    medical advice, diagnosis or treatment, and it does not create any clinician–patient relationship.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Do not use {site.name} to diagnose or treat any health condition.</li>
    <li>Do not delay seeking, or disregard, professional medical advice because of something you read or saw here.</li>
    <li>Always follow the guidance of qualified health professionals and your institution’s clinical protocols.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Not a substitute for clinical training</h2>
  <p>
    Nursing, medical and other health-science students may find our simulations helpful for visualizing mechanisms.
    However, they are not a substitute for accredited coursework, supervised clinical practice, professional judgment or
    official clinical references.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy and sources</h2>
  <p>
    We base our content on reputable references and list them on each simulator page. Science advances and mistakes can
    happen, so we cannot guarantee that all content is complete or current. Please <a href="/contact/">report any
    errors</a> so we can correct them.
  </p>

  <h2>Safety</h2>
  <p>
    Some pages describe real-world experiments or applications. Do not attempt laboratory procedures, handle chemicals or
    perform any activity described on this site without appropriate supervision, training and safety equipment.
  </p>
</ProseLayout>
